{"nodes": [{"author": null, "captured_at": null, "contributor": null, "file_type": "document", "id": "docs_base_de_datos", "label": "docs/base-de-datos.md \u2014 documentaci\u00f3n de la base de datos", "rationale": null, "source_file": "docs/base-de-datos.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "_origin": "semantic"}, {"author": null, "captured_at": null, "contributor": null, "file_type": "code", "id": "backend_app_models", "label": "backend/app/models.py \u2014 8 tablas como clases ORM", "rationale": "Fuente de verdad del esquema; SQLAlchemy genera el CREATE TABLE v\u00eda app/init_db.py.", "source_file": "docs/base-de-datos.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "_origin": "semantic"}, {"author": null, "captured_at": null, "contributor": null, "file_type": "code", "id": "backend_routers_productos", "label": "backend/app/routers/productos.py \u2014 CRUD productos, galer\u00eda, _stock_combo_efectivo", "rationale": null, "source_file": "docs/base-de-datos.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "_origin": "semantic"}, {"author": null, "captured_at": null, "contributor": null, "file_type": "code", "id": "backend_routers_pedidos", "label": "backend/app/routers/pedidos.py \u2014 creaci\u00f3n/edici\u00f3n de pedidos, _movimientos_stock", "rationale": null, "source_file": "docs/base-de-datos.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "_origin": "semantic"}, {"author": null, "captured_at": null, "contributor": null, "file_type": "code", "id": "backend_app_init_db", "label": "backend/app/init_db.py \u2014 create_all + micromigraciones", "rationale": "Migraciones idempotentes (solo ADD COLUMN) en vez de Alembic; se corren a mano porque en serverless no hay arranque persistente donde ejecutarlas.", "source_file": "docs/base-de-datos.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "_origin": "semantic"}, {"author": null, "captured_at": null, "contributor": null, "file_type": "concept", "id": "db_productos", "label": "Tabla productos", "rationale": "Tabla central: los combos son filas con categoria='combo' (no hay tabla 'combos'); su stock no se edita, se calcula del stock de los componentes.", "source_file": "docs/base-de-datos.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "_origin": "semantic"}, {"author": null, "captured_at": "2026-09-14", "contributor": null, "file_type": "concept", "id": "db_producto_imagenes", "label": "Tabla producto_imagenes (galer\u00eda)", "rationale": "Fuente de verdad de la galer\u00eda; la foto principal vive denormalizada en productos.imagen_url a prop\u00f3sito (cards, carrusel y carrito ya la leen); antes las subidas pisaban la foto anterior, ahora hacen append.", "source_file": "docs/base-de-datos.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "_origin": "semantic"}, {"author": null, "captured_at": null, "contributor": null, "file_type": "concept", "id": "db_combo_items", "label": "Tabla combo_items (receta de combos)", "rationale": "Tabla intermedia con DOS FKs a productos (combo y componente); grupo NULL = componente fijo, mismo label = opciones a elecci\u00f3n del cliente.", "source_file": "docs/base-de-datos.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "_origin": "semantic"}, {"author": null, "captured_at": null, "contributor": null, "file_type": "concept", "id": "db_pedidos", "label": "Tabla pedidos", "rationale": "Modelo B2B: cliente_nombre es el local que pide; el contacto real es WhatsApp; m\u00e9todo_pago se cobra aparte.", "source_file": "docs/base-de-datos.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "_origin": "semantic"}, {"author": null, "captured_at": null, "contributor": null, "file_type": "concept", "id": "db_pedido_items", "label": "Tabla pedido_items (snapshot)", "rationale": "La m\u00e1s importante: guarda copias de nombre/precio del momento del pedido y la FK producto_id es nullable, para que los hist\u00f3ricos sobrevivan a cambios de precio y borrados; sin esto 'lo m\u00e1s vendido' se romper\u00eda.", "source_file": "docs/base-de-datos.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "_origin": "semantic"}, {"author": null, "captured_at": null, "contributor": null, "file_type": "concept", "id": "db_categorias", "label": "Tabla categor\u00edas", "rationale": "Match con productos.categoria por NOMBRE sin FK: SQLite no soporta ALTER TABLE ADD CONSTRAINT y las micromigraciones solo permiten ADD COLUMN; los renombres los maneja el backend en cascada. 'combo' es nombre reservado.", "source_file": "docs/base-de-datos.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "_origin": "semantic"}, {"author": null, "captured_at": null, "contributor": null, "file_type": "concept", "id": "db_admin_users", "label": "Tabla admin_users (login del due\u00f1o)", "rationale": "Aislada del resto: no hay usuarios clientes ni registro; la password nunca se guarda en claro (bcrypt).", "source_file": "docs/base-de-datos.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "_origin": "semantic"}, {"author": null, "captured_at": null, "contributor": null, "file_type": "concept", "id": "db_local_config", "label": "Tabla local_config (singleton de configuraci\u00f3n)", "rationale": "Singleton (siempre una fila con id=1, forzado por c\u00f3digo, no esquema); habilita el rebrandeo del sitio por cliente sin tocar c\u00f3digo.", "source_file": "docs/base-de-datos.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "_origin": "semantic"}, {"author": null, "captured_at": null, "contributor": null, "file_type": "concept", "id": "snapshot_pricing", "label": "Precios snapshot calculados por el backend", "rationale": "Ninguna tabla guarda precios que manda el cliente: el backend recalcula desde el cat\u00e1logo al ped\u00edr; importa para plantilla multi-cliente (la integridad vive en un solo lugar).", "source_file": "docs/base-de-datos.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "_origin": "semantic"}, {"author": null, "captured_at": null, "contributor": null, "file_type": "concept", "id": "combo_stock_efectivo", "label": "Stock efectivo de combos", "rationale": "El combo no reserva stock: cu\u00e1ntos se pueden armar sale de los componentes (fijos: stock//cantidad; grupos: suma de opciones // N); al cancelar/editar se reintegra exactamente.", "source_file": "docs/base-de-datos.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "_origin": "semantic"}, {"author": null, "captured_at": null, "contributor": null, "file_type": "concept", "id": "images_gallery", "label": "Galer\u00eda multi-imagen de productos", "rationale": null, "source_file": "docs/base-de-datos.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "_origin": "semantic"}, {"author": null, "captured_at": null, "contributor": null, "file_type": "concept", "id": "micromigraciones", "label": "Patr\u00f3n de micromigraciones (ALTER TABLE ADD COLUMN idempotente)", "rationale": "Alembic descartado por alcance: m\u00e1s simple de explicar; regla de portabilidad: solo ADD COLUMN con constantes para ser v\u00e1lido en SQLite y Postgres.", "source_file": "docs/base-de-datos.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "_origin": "semantic"}], "edges": [{"confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source": "docs_base_de_datos", "source_file": "docs/base-de-datos.md", "source_location": null, "target": "docs_base_de_datos_html", "weight": 1, "_origin": "semantic"}, {"confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source": "docs_base_de_datos", "source_file": "docs/base-de-datos.md", "source_location": "Secci\u00f3n 1/2", "target": "backend_app_config", "weight": 1, "_origin": "semantic"}, {"confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source": "docs_base_de_datos", "source_file": "docs/base-de-datos.md", "source_location": "Secci\u00f3n 1/2", "target": "backend_app_database", "weight": 1, "_origin": "semantic"}, {"confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source": "docs_base_de_datos", "source_file": "docs/base-de-datos.md", "source_location": "Secci\u00f3n 2", "target": "backend_app_models", "weight": 1, "_or